&lt;p&gt;Req ID: R3105&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Ranges:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Remote Germany&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€68.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€91.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At IONOS, the leading European provider of cloud infrastructure, cloud services and hosting services, you will work together with a wide range of teams. We are characterized by open structures, a friendly working culture and flat hierarchies with a strong team spirit. We firmly believe that work and fun are compatible, and offer you the right environment for this. Our constant growth means that we are always looking for new colleagues. Become part of IONOS and grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Working Student in AI Growth Marketing, you will support our B2B Domains marketing team in driving and scaling innovative, AI-powered initiatives across content, CRM, and performance marketing in a dynamic test-and-learn environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Tasks&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the B2B Domains marketing team in planning, executing, and optimizing AI-driven growth marketing initiatives across content, CRM, and performance marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and adapt marketing content (landing pages, emails, social posts, ads) using generative AI tools — from first draft to publication-ready copy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build and maintain CRM and email automation workflows, including segmentation, A/B testing, and campaign setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in managing performance marketing campaigns (e.g. paid search, paid social) and monitor budgets, results, and learnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support reporting and attribution: maintain dashboards, analyze campaign data, and prepare clear summaries for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute your own ideas — we run a test-and-learn culture and value fresh perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Learn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How an AI-first B2B marketing organization works in practice — tools, processes, and skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience across the full funnel: content, CRM, performance marketing, and analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How to design, run, and evaluate experiments with solid measurement and ROI thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enrolled student (Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s) in marketing, business, communications, data/analytics, or a related field for the duration of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in AI and digital marketing, with initial practical experience using generative AI tools (e.g., ChatGPT, Claude, image/creative tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First experience in online marketing, CRM, content creation, or performance marketing (through internships, personal projects, or previous working student roles).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset and comfort working with data, including Excel/Sheets skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, curious, reliable way of working, and open to technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with agentic AI coding tools such as Claude Code is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial exposure to web or digital analytics tools is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of domains, hosting, cloud, or digital infrastructure is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English (spoken and written); German skills are welcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Benefits&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours to easily combine studies with practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern office space with very good transport connections in Berlin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidized canteen and free drinks at our office location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee discounts on various activities, products, and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee events such as summer/winter parties and team workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numerous learning and development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About IONOS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;IONOS is the leading European digitalization partner for small and medium-sized businesses (SMB). The company serves around six million customers and operates across 18 markets in Europe and North America, with its services being accessible worldwide. With its Web Presence &amp;amp; Productivity portfolio, IONOS acts as a &#39;one-stop shop&#39; for all digitalization needs: from domains and web hosting to classic website builders and do-it-yourself solutions, from e-commerce to online marketing tools. In addition, the company offers Cloud Solutions to enterprises who are looking to move to the cloud as their businesses evolve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;We value diversity and welcome all applications - regardless of,&amp;nbsp;for example, gender, nationality, ethnic&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;social origin, religion, disability, age as well as sexual orientation and identity, physical characteristics, marital status or any other irrelevant factor subject to applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GROPYUS is a technology-based construction company focused on building multi-story residential buildings. Thanks to its prefabricated building system with various design options, industrial offsite construction, and fully digitalized processes, the company manufactures aspirational, sustainable, and affordable homes using timber construction methods. GROPYUS is using scalable construction and manufacturing solutions to tap into a future market, boost Europe&#39;s strength in innovation, while also playing a substantial role in improving sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be part of a highly collaborative product team working at the core of our manufacturing facility, transforming digital models into physical elements at scale. Product Teams at GROPYUS own what they build, including the underlying infrastructure, build pipelines, automated testing, release and rollout management, monitoring, and support. You will be trusted to solve problems efficiently and effectively, building on top of a solid architecture and operational foundation, and will be encouraged to seek out under-attended topics and assume responsibility for them both within your product area and across product areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer, you have an impact across multiple teams within your product area. Staff Engineers effectively collaborate with other Staff Engineers and foster a culture of regular exchange and cooperation. Their ability to communicate effectively and take initiative ensures that they not only contribute to the technical success of projects, but also help drive overall growth and innovation within the company by sharing both best practices and failures, and learning from them. With your focus on and experience in SRE / operating large systems, you will drive and spearhead operational excellence within your product area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer (f/m/d) on the Production Platform team, you will be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and building the software at the core of our manufacturing and owning the integrations that connect it to physical machines and vendor systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading technical initiatives that ensure software systems are reliable, maintainable, and operationally sound, especially in logistics- and manufacturing-heavy domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working in a hybrid infrastructure environment (cloud and on-prem), managing complex software deployments at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bringing a Site Reliability Engineering (SRE) mindset to monitor, maintain, and improve software uptime, including reliable updates, latency, and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as a bridge between digital product delivery and physical logistics and manufacturing systems, including assessing vendors for integration fitness, owning buy-vs-build decisions, and negotiating API changes with machine and equipment vendors toward usable, maintainable interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentoring engineers across multiple teams and improving system-wide architecture, a maintainable and sound codebase, and operational excellence incl. incident handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping define, monitor, and evolve SLAs/SLOs as well as other important KPIs like e.g. OEE for critical systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an experienced software engineer with a strong background in Site Reliability Engineering or operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess practical experience in all key areas of modern software development, including infrastructure, observability, testing, deployment pipelines incl. quality assurance, and scaling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve operated and supported large-scale software systems in cloud and non-cloud environments (on-premise)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve worked in companies with strong operational cultures, ideally in logistics or manufacturing — understanding the commercial impact of system downtime&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable owning integrations with external systems, and can shape and negotiate vendor or machine APIs toward maintainable, scalable interfaces rather than working around whatever you&#39;re handed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience mentoring and guiding engineers at various levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient with most of the following technologies:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kotlin / SpringBoot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TimeFold / Camunda / BPMN / Optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python / Bash is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OPC-UA / PLC / SPS is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring Cloud Operations experience
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Azure is a bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re familiar with monitoring and alerting practices for production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with defining and working with SLAs/SLOs is a bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are willing to travel within Germany for in-person team events as well as visiting our manufacturing location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be part of something big:&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;You’re here to make a change? Come on board. At GROPYUS, we are on a mission to re-think an entire industry. Join us in reinventing construction and sustainable, affordable living.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;It’s on you:&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;We offer a tremendous amount of ownership and room to make a mark - at all our organization levels. Find your solutions, drive and test them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Focus on results:&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;You choose if you work from home, a park, or the office. Whether you start your day early, after your run, or pick up on work when your kids are in bed. What counts is your contribution and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bring your uniqueness to the team&lt;/em&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Innovation requires diversity of thought. Diversity in background, experience and thinking is crucial to create the best product for everyone. We actively seek diversity and strive to unlock each other’s full potential. We are very proud that people from all industries and all walks of life are joining our company – in addition to core areas such as construction, engineering, and start-ups, from stock-listed companies from across automotive e-Commerce, digital, sporting goods, and more. You will work in international teams with passionate colleagues. Inspire and be inspired.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be an owner:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;Participate in the success of GROPYUS through stock options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Join us on our mission to design buildings as continuously evolving products to create the most exciting and affordable experience for all. We build for people and conserve the resources of our planet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We can&#39;t wait to get to know you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;For more information, visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gropyus.com/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;, and if you have any questions, please reach out to us via&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;email&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GROPYUS is a technology-based construction company focused on building multi-story residential buildings. Thanks to its prefabricated building system with various design options, industrial offsite construction, and fully digitalized processes, the company manufactures aspirational, sustainable, and affordable homes using timber construction methods. GROPYUS is using scalable construction and manufacturing solutions to tap into a future market, boost Europe&#39;s strength in innovation, while also playing a substantial role in improving sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-ccp-timestamp=&quot;1733994062731&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Über die Rolle:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kaufmännische Betreuung und Steuerung von Bauprojekten in enger Zusammenarbeit mit der technischen Projekt- und Bauleitung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sicherstellung der Einhaltung von Budgets, Kosten- und Ergebniszielen und frühzeitige Identifizierung von Chancen und Risiken im Projektverlauf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erstellung, Prüfung und Bearbeitung von Nachunternehmer-, Lieferanten-, Abschlags- und Schlussrechnungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vertragsmanagement gegenüber Auftraggebern, Nachunternehmern und Lieferanten einschließlich der Begleitung vertraglicher Fragestellungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prüfung und Freigabe von Rechnungen sowie Sicherstellung eines ordnungsgemäßen Zahlungs- und Forderungsmanagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erstellung aussagekräftiger kaufmännischer Reportings, Analysen und Forecasts für interne und externe Stakeholder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steuerung, Weiterentwicklung und Optimierung kaufmännischer Prozesse innerhalb der Projekte sowie Sicherstellung einer vollständigen und nachvollziehbaren Projektdokumentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kaufmännische Begleitung von Ausschreibungs-, Vergabe- und Beschaffungsprozessen unter Berücksichtigung wirtschaftlicher und strategischer Aspekte&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beratung der technischen Projektleitung und des Managements als kaufmännischer Sparringspartner bei wirtschaftlichen Fragestellungen und Projektentscheidungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kommunikation und Verhandlung mit Auftraggebern, Nachunternehmern, Lieferanten, Behörden, Banken und weiteren externen Partnern&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifikation, Bewertung und Steuerung projektrelevanter kaufmännischer Chancen und Risiken zur Sicherstellung des nachhaltigen Projekterfolgs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Über dich:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfolgreich abgeschlossene kaufmännische Ausbildung, idealerweise als Baukauffrau/-mann oder eine vergleichbare Qualifikation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;mehrjährige Erfahrung in der Bauwirtschaft, vorzugsweise bei einem Generalübernehmer oder Bauunternehmen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sicherer Umgang mit MS Office und idealerweise ERP-Systemen wie RIB iTWO, SAP oder vergleichbaren Bau-Softwarelösungen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strukturierte, eigenverantwortliche und sorgfältige Arbeitsweise&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teamfähigkeit und Kommunikationsstärke&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Deutsch- und gute Englischkenntnisse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bereitschaft ab und zu nach Berlin zu reisen für einen persönlichen Austausch mit deinem Team (solltest du nicht in Berlin oder Umgebung wohnen)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was wir bieten:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ein unbefristeter Vertrag mit 30 Urlaubstagen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Flexible Arbeitsweise: Wir legen großen Wert auf regelmäßige persönliche Zusammenarbeit im Büro, und bieten auch die Möglichkeit zum Arbeiten im Homeoffice sowie die Option, bis zu 40 Tage im Jahr aus dem Ausland zu arbeiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Attraktive Zusatzleistungen: Wir bieten eine betriebliche Altersvorsorge, Sprachkurse (Englisch/Deutsch) und Mitarbeiterrabatte bei ausgewählten nachhaltigen Marken. Darüber hinaus unterstützen Dich unsere externen Partner im Bereich mentale Gesundheit, um Deine psychische Gesundheit durch anonyme Einzel- oder Gruppensitzungen zu stärken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Virtuelles Aktienprogramm: Profitiere von GROPYUS Erfolg durch unser Virtuelles Aktienprogramm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Eigenverantwortung: Du kannst wirklich etwas bewirken – auf allen Ebenen unserer Organisation. Finde Lösungen, treibe sie voran, teste und implementiere sie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Die Chance, Teil von etwas Großem zu sein: Unsere Mission ist es, eine ganze Branche neu zu denken. Hilf uns dabei, das Bauwesen neu zu erfinden und nachhaltiges, erschwingliches Wohnen zu fördern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Ein vielfältiges und bereicherndes Arbeitsumfeld: Werde ein geschätztes Mitglied eines wunderbar vielfältigen Teams von Menschen aus über 50 Ländern. Bei GROPYUS legen wir großen Wert auf Inklusion und sorgen dafür, dass sich jeder – unabhängig von seinem Hintergrund – als Teil der Gemeinschaft fühlt. So werden unsere Unterschiede zu Stärken, die uns als Team weiterbringen.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Join us on our mission to design buildings as continuously evolving products to create the most exciting and affordable experience for all. We build for people and conserve the resources of our planet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We can&#39;t wait to get to know you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;For more information, visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gropyus.com/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;, and if you have any questions, please reach out to us via&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;email&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The world of digital assets is accelerating in speed, magnitude, and complexity, opening the door to new ways for leveraging the blockchain. Fireblocks’ platform and network provide the simplest and most secure way for companies to work with digital assets and it trusted by some of the largest financial institutions, banks, globally-recognized brands, and Web3 companies in the world, including BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Revolut, and thousands more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Fireblocks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fireblocks is the institutional standard for digital asset security and settlement. We enable banks, fintechs, and exchanges—like BNY Mellon, Revolut, and ANZ—to securely navigate the blockchain economy. Our platform and network provide the simplest and most secure way for companies to work with digital assets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Mission: Quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;The Financial Apps unit builds the critical infrastructure that connects institutions to the digital asset economy. Our products cover everything from staking and yield to on-ramps, exchange integrations, and Web3 connectivity (e.g. WalletConnect).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll manually test all flows that need validation, and contribute to building out our automation the rest of the time. We need someone who treats quality as a holistic product challenge, takes pride in rigorous manual testing, and is eager to help grow our automation—using AI to move faster at every stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Holistic Quality Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You own the quality of the product end-to-end. You don&#39;t just test against a spec; you analyze the spec, find the logical gaps, and suggest improvements to ensure a better final product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Manual QA:&lt;/strong&gt; You design and execute thorough manual test plans across complex financial and Web3 flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Powered Velocity:&lt;/strong&gt; You leverage AI agents (e.g., Claude Code) to accelerate your workflow, expand coverage, and ship faster without sacrificing depth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep-Dive Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable digging into logs and monitoring tools (Datadog/Sentry) to understand why something broke. You aren&#39;t afraid to get your hands dirty in the backend to find the root cause.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; When you&#39;re not running manual flows, you help build and maintain automation across backend APIs and frontend interfaces in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t see yourself as &quot;just a tester.&quot; You are an engineer with a product mindset who actively works to improve the systems you are checking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You take real pride in finding what others miss — exploratory testing and edge-case hunting genuinely excite you, and you&#39;d rather break something today than let a user break it tomorrow. You do both automation and manual testing, and treat both as core parts of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;3+ years in Manual QA&amp;nbsp;with hands-on automation experience across the full stack (TypeScript preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Solid grasp of blockchain fundamentals, the transaction lifecycle, and DeFi logic like staking and bridging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;AI-native - you already use AI tools daily to move faster and cut through complex errors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Fast learner - new domains don&#39;t slow you down; you keep pace in an industry that moves at the speed of crypto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Data-driven debugger - when something breaks, logs are your first move, not your last resort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe&amp;nbsp;our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we&amp;nbsp;embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Please see our candidate privacy policy here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2994 - Business Director, Programmatic and Social - GCS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
