&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-m-mwmz cui-body-regular-hd7o cui-body-normal-pvqj css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which you can be used to attend conferences and/or advancing your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-m-mwmz cui-body-regular-hd7o cui-body-normal-pvqj css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-m-mwmz cui-body-regular-hd7o cui-body-normal-pvqj css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🏖️ Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-m-mwmz cui-body-regular-hd7o cui-body-normal-pvqj css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🚵🏾‍♂️ Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, subsidised office lunches&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-m-mwmz cui-body-regular-hd7o cui-body-normal-pvqj css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service 🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-m-mwmz cui-body-regular-hd7o cui-body-normal-pvqj css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-m-mwmz cui-body-semibold-pt76 cui-body-normal-pvqj cui-body-highlight-kmah css-10dm8y e173j6r82&quot;&gt;About SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-m-mwmz cui-body-regular-hd7o cui-body-normal-pvqj css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;We believe in the everyday hero.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-m-mwmz cui-body-regular-hd7o cui-body-normal-pvqj css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;Small business owners are at the heart of all we do, so we&#39;re creating tools that help them run their businesses. With a founder’s mentality and a &#39;team-first’ attitude, our diverse teams across Europe, South America and the United States work together to ensure that the small business owners we partner with can be successful doing what they love.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-m-mwmz cui-body-regular-hd7o cui-body-normal-pvqj css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-m-mwmz cui-body-regular-hd7o cui-body-normal-pvqj css-x0oz0e e173j6r83&quot;&gt;SumUp is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer that proudly pursues and hires a diverse workforce. SumUp does not make hiring or employment decisions on the basis of race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. SumUp also strives for a healthy and safe workplace and strictly prohibits harassment of any kind.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-m-mwmz cui-body-regular-hd7o cui-body-normal-pvqj css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-m-mwmz cui-body-regular-hd7o cui-body-normal-pvqj css-x0oz0e e173j6r83&quot;&gt;SumUp will not accept unsolicited resumes from any source other than directly from a candidate.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-m-mwmz cui-body-regular-hd7o cui-body-normal-pvqj css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-m-mwmz cui-body-semibold-pt76 cui-body-normal-pvqj cui-body-highlight-kmah css-10dm8y e173j6r82&quot;&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cui-body-o5xe cui-body-m-mwmz cui-body-regular-hd7o cui-body-normal-pvqj css-k4eprn&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At IONOS, the leading European provider of cloud infrastructure, cloud services and hosting services, you will work together with a wide range of teams. We are characterized by open structures, a friendly working culture and flat hierarchies with a strong team spirit. We firmly believe that work and fun are compatible, and offer you the right environment for this. Our constant growth means that we are always looking for new colleagues. Become part of IONOS and grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join our Product Management team as a Working Student in Domains &amp;amp; SSL and support data-driven decisions that propel our business forward. In this role, you will gain hands-on experience in product strategy, commercial analysis, and reporting while working closely with cross-functional teams to shape product performance across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Tasks&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Gain insights into product roadmaps, planning, and strategy for both German and international markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Insight:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop commercial acumen and competitor insights by analyzing the hosting and domain landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Report Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain KPI dashboards using tools like Power BI and Looker to monitor operational performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Analysis &amp;amp; Validation:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze key data points to generate impactful business insights and ensure data accuracy through hands-on validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Optimization &amp;amp; Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Enhance reporting processes and explore innovative data visualization approaches. Utilize Python or similar tools for data management and reporting automation to boost team productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Propose new ideas to continuously refine KPI analyses and decision-making processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enrolled student in Business Informatics (Wirtschaftsinformatik), Data Science, Business Analytics, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with MS Office / Google Workspace tools; experience with Power BI or Looker is a plus, and basic Python skills are welcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with initial experience or confidence in stakeholder communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills with a structured, solution-oriented approach to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English; German language skills are an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in Product Management, business performance, and KPI analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Benefits&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours through trust-based working hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At some locations a subsidized canteen and various free drinks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern office space with very good transport connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various employee discounts for activities and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee events such as summer and winter parties, as well as workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numerous training and development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health offers, such as sports and health courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About IONOS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;IONOS is the leading European digitalization partner for small and medium-sized businesses (SMB). The company serves around six million customers and operates across 18 markets in Europe and North America, with its services being accessible worldwide. With its Web Presence &amp;amp; Productivity portfolio, IONOS acts as a &#39;one-stop shop&#39; for all digitalization needs: from domains and web hosting to classic website builders and do-it-yourself solutions, from e-commerce to online marketing tools. In addition, the company offers Cloud Solutions to enterprises who are looking to move to the cloud as their businesses evolve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;We value diversity and welcome all applications - regardless of,&amp;nbsp;for example, gender, nationality, ethnic&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;social origin, religion, disability, age as well as sexual orientation and identity, physical characteristics, marital status or any other irrelevant factor subject to applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At IONOS, the leading European provider of cloud infrastructure, cloud services and hosting services, you will work together with a wide range of teams. We are characterized by open structures, a friendly working culture and flat hierarchies with a strong team spirit. We firmly believe that work and fun are compatible, and offer you the right environment for this. Our constant growth means that we are always looking for new colleagues. Become part of IONOS and grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join our Product Management team as a Working Student in Domains &amp;amp; SSL and help turn market, customer, and business insight into better product decisions. In this role, you will collaborate with cross-functional teams to analyze trends, evaluate performance, and support strategic product growth across German and international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Tasks&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Learn how product roadmaps, planning, and strategy come together across German and international markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market &amp;amp; Competitor Research:&lt;/strong&gt; Track the hosting and domain landscape—competitor moves, pricing, positioning, and emerging trends—and translate findings into clear, actionable summaries for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Care &amp;amp; Customer Insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Customer Care and Customer Insights teams to capture the voice of the customer, surfacing recurring pain points, feedback themes, and satisfaction signals to inform product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business &amp;amp; Commercial Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Build commercial acumen by examining domain and SSL business performance, exploring underlying trends, and supporting business cases for new initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Insight:&lt;/strong&gt; Help maintain and interpret KPI dashboards (Power BI, Looker) tracking product, market, and customer performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to market studies, benchmarking, and ad-hoc analyses that inform roadmap and strategy discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Bring fresh ideas for analyzing markets, understanding customers, and sharpening decision-making processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enrolled student in Business Administration, Economics, Business Analytics, International Management, Business Informatics (Wirtschaftsinformatik), or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and analytical mindset, comfortable working with both qualitative research and quantitative data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident with MS Office and Google Workspace tools; experience with Power BI or Looker is a plus, and basic Python knowledge is welcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and a structured, solution-oriented way of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to collaborate across teams and present findings clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-focused mindset with a genuine interest in product strategy, markets, and overall business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English; German language skills are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Benefits&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours through trust-based working hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At some locations a subsidized canteen and various free drinks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern office space with very good transport connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various employee discounts for activities and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee events such as summer and winter parties, as well as workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numerous training and development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health offers, such as sports and health courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About IONOS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;IONOS is the leading European digitalization partner for small and medium-sized businesses (SMB). The company serves around six million customers and operates across 18 markets in Europe and North America, with its services being accessible worldwide. With its Web Presence &amp;amp; Productivity portfolio, IONOS acts as a &#39;one-stop shop&#39; for all digitalization needs: from domains and web hosting to classic website builders and do-it-yourself solutions, from e-commerce to online marketing tools. In addition, the company offers Cloud Solutions to enterprises who are looking to move to the cloud as their businesses evolve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;We value diversity and welcome all applications - regardless of,&amp;nbsp;for example, gender, nationality, ethnic&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;social origin, religion, disability, age as well as sexual orientation and identity, physical characteristics, marital status or any other irrelevant factor subject to applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At IONOS, the leading European provider of cloud infrastructure, cloud services and hosting services, you will work together with a wide range of teams. We are characterized by open structures, a friendly working culture and flat hierarchies with a strong team spirit. We firmly believe that work and fun are compatible, and offer you the right environment for this. Our constant growth means that we are always looking for new colleagues. Become part of IONOS and grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re launching a brand-new AI Agent platform that will become the digital assistant of choice for small- and medium-businesses (SMBs). This platform features various intelligent, autonomous agents handling tasks from customer interactions — like reservations and support — to strategic initiatives like marketing campaigns and sales. You&#39;ll be instrumental in developing the core application that enables these agents to operate, learn, and collaborate, ultimately driving significant value for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This pivotal role involves defining the technology roadmap, architectural standards, and technical direction for a large-scale, distributed system. If you&#39;re passionate about applying cutting-edge AI and agentic technologies to solve real-world business challenges, join our motivated team at the forefront of modern product development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires an architect who is deeply immersed in the fast-moving AI field and possesses a comprehensive mastery of Deep AI and Agentic Technology. The ideal candidate must focus on solving real customer problems by working backwards from the user to the tech stack, while successfully embracing ambiguity as an opportunity in a newly defined space. In this role, you will be expected to display:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep AI &amp;amp; Agentic Technology Mastery&lt;/strong&gt;: Requires practical, hands-on understanding of modern AI (LLMs, multi-modal, tool use), multi-agent systems architecture, continuous tracking of emerging frameworks (like LangGraph, CrewAI, AutoGen), and embedding responsible AI guardrails and observability into the architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User-Centric Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: Focuses on solving real customer problems by starting from SMB operator realities and working backwards to translate fuzzy needs into precise technical ecosystems, validating assumptions via discovery sprints, and articulating technical trade-offs based on user impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thriving in Ambiguity&lt;/strong&gt;: Mandates a strong bias for action (prioritizing prototypes and speed-to-value), full end-to-end ownership of outcomes, constructive problem-solving with early risk mitigation, and balancing startup velocity with enterprise engineering discipline for scalable production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tasks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architectural Design&lt;/strong&gt; Design and evolve the architecture for a large-scale, distributed system capable of serving extensive customer bases and processing massive data volumes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology Evaluation&lt;/strong&gt; Evaluate and select the optimal technology stack, focusing on modern web technologies and AI foundational platforms, including agent workflow platforms and builder frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Integration&lt;/strong&gt; Define interfaces to enable seamless agent interaction, information sharing, and autonomous action triggering, incorporating necessary Human-in-the-Loop checks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the subject matter expert on system design, providing technical guidance to development teams and ensuring adherence to architectural standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with various teams across the organization to clarify technical requirements and establish architectural standards and interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge Systems&lt;/strong&gt; Design components for agent knowledge, including strategies for Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) and the use of vector and distributed databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay Ahead of the Curve&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously research and track advancements in the AI domain, with a specific focus on agentic AI, to maintain a cutting-edge technology stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 8–10 years of experience in designing and implementing large-scale distributed systems and high-traffic customer-facing applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in Technology and Software companies, FinTech, E-Commerce, or related fields. Exposure to Cloud Services, SaaS, AI, and Automation is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic AI Domain: Deep understanding of modern AI foundational technologies, including expertise in agent workflow platforms and builder frameworks (e.g. LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI, AutoGen).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distributed Systems Expertise: Strong familiarity with RAG, vector databases, and modern distributed database architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; Deployment: Proficiency with containerization and orchestration (Kubernetes) and experience deploying on major cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, Azure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Acumen: Ability to rapidly evaluate new technologies, articulate trade-offs, and make sound recommendations under uncertainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable, hands-on fluency with state-of-the-art AI models and agentic frameworks — evidenced by projects, prototypes, or published work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of translating ambiguous user needs into concrete, well-reasoned technical architectures in fast-moving product environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio of moments where you pushed a project forward despite uncertainty, resource constraints, or stakeholder hesitation — and succeeded.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, negotiation, and influencing skills to convey complex technical concepts across diverse teams and seniority levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead by example, mentor engineers, and foster a culture of curiosity, ownership, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours through trust-based working hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At some locations a subsidized canteen and various free drinks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern office space with very good transport connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various employee discounts for activities and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee events such as summer and winter parties, as well as workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numerous training and development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health offers, such as sports and health courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About IONOS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;IONOS is the leading European digitalization partner for small and medium-sized businesses (SMB). The company serves around six million customers and operates across 18 markets in Europe and North America, with its services being accessible worldwide. With its Web Presence &amp;amp; Productivity portfolio, IONOS acts as a &#39;one-stop shop&#39; for all digitalization needs: from domains and web hosting to classic website builders and do-it-yourself solutions, from e-commerce to online marketing tools. In addition, the company offers Cloud Solutions to enterprises who are looking to move to the cloud as their businesses evolve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;We value diversity and welcome all applications - regardless of,&amp;nbsp;for example, gender, nationality, ethnic&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;social origin, religion, disability, age as well as sexual orientation and identity, physical characteristics, marital status or any other irrelevant factor subject to applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
